Linux compat for package:skyline widgets/texture.dart.

Headless Linux native-view fallback.  The public engine has no platform-view
registry, so SkylineTextureView uses a synthetic texture id and an opaque,
pointer-listening placeholder (black slot).  Pointer events still flow through
SkylineWidgetsFlutterBinding.forwardNativeViewPointerEvent into the runtime's
HandleNativeViewPointerEvent.

